<title>CHINA: China steel output up 5.4 pct in first quarter.</title>
<headline>China steel output up 5.4 pct in first quarter.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's steel output rose 5.4 percent in the first quarter to 25.43 million tonnes, the State Statistical Bureau said on Friday.</p>
<p>Output of rolled steel rose 8.3 percent to 22.08 million tonnes, it said.</p>
</text>
